{
  "name": "Multi-Agent Content System - Orchestrator",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🤖 MULTI-AGENT CONTENT SYSTEM — ORCHESTRATOR\n**5 specialist agents, each in its own sub-workflow.**\n🔎 Research → ✅ Validator → 🧠 Strategist → 🎨 Creative + Images → 📤 Publisher\n\nRun from the **dashboard**, **Content Form** or **webhook**. `script` format stops after the Strategist.\n\n**First-time setup:** import the 5 sub-workflows, publish them, then select each one in its matching *Agent* node here.",
        "width": 900,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "baaf648a-e115-4eb7-ad03-8e0a174619ed",
      "name": "Note 6011",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Agent team\nDouble-click an agent node's **View sub-workflow** link to see how that agent works.",
        "width": 820,
        "height": 130,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "49e6c358-96d6-42eb-8ad4-e13dfe29816a",
      "name": "Note f349",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
